&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Senior Product Owner (d/f/m)&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;Hamburg, Berlin, Hybrid&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;DEPT® is a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, our 4,000+ specialists deliver growth invention services across Brand &amp;amp; Media, Experience, Commerce, CRM, and Technology &amp;amp; Data. We’re 50|50 tech and marketing, partner-led, and first to move. Clients include Google, Lufthansa, Meta, eBay, and OpenAI. We have been certified B Corp and Climate Neutral since 2021.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;JOB PURPOSE&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role is part of our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experience &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;em&gt; team in Germany. We combine technology and experience design to create emotive yet conversion-focused ideas, products, and campaigns at scale and speed. Our specialty is digital experiences and communication that change perceptions and shape new behaviours to make a difference in the market.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In a central key role, you will oversee the implementation of our complex B2C and B2B projects. This includes consulting of our clients, planning and facilitating scoping workshops, initial setup and grooming of product backlogs, creating and prioritising epics &amp;amp; user stories, developing product roadmaps, and leading the projects to launch.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU’LL DO:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Consulting our clients on the project scope in terms of e.g. features, priority and (business) impact;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Planning and executing project discovery phases together with our other craft experts;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with our delivery team to plan and execute project iterations and follow-up with the necessary ceremonies and meetings;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning and managing the project scope and the expectations that come with it and communicating progress and issues excellently both internally and with stakeholders / clients while working hand in hand with our project management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leading our projects to success – by your diverse expertise in creation, strategy, quality and tech, and by involving external and internal stakeholder&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working proficiency in both German and English (C1, spoken and written)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in a similar position and within e-commerce (B2C/B2B) or similar IT projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in agile methodologies as well as leading interdisciplinary teams;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;IT agency experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A high sense of responsibility &amp;amp; ownership and the willingness to steer, control and make decisions in order to ensure the success of your projects;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Extensive knowledge of common project management methods and tools (Jira, Confluence);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep skills in requirements engineering and scope management;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical, strategic, and coordination skills;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Empathetic and recipient-oriented communication and a confident appearance towards various stakeholders;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid consulting expertise to lead our clients to their desired outcome;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in planning and conducting internal and external workshops based on a variety of formats;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ideally a certified Product Owner (CSPO / ACSPO; although long-term project experience is the primary focus);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Preferably some experience on the agency or service provider side;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to work with and lead international teams;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WE OFFER:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible, hybrid working policy (1-2 days at the office, depending on location);&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lease bike options / JobRad and 25% subsidy for the Deutschlandticket.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasional breakfast/lunch at the office, Smoothie Tuesdays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay happy and healthy with a contribution to your health through the OpenUp platform;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;€50 personal monthly allowance via our dedicated benefits apps for use across daily expenses and lifestyle perks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Future Bens - Exclusive access to sustainable, healthy products at attractive deals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Social events, plenty of opportunities to connect with colleagues through organised activities and celebrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A reputation for doing good. DEPT® has been a Certified &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/en-gb/insight/dept-is-a-certified-b-corporation/&quot;&gt;B Corp® since 2021&lt;/a&gt; and named ‘Agency of the Year’ at both The Lovies and The Webby Awards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awesome clients. Whether big or small, local or global — at DEPT® you’ll get the opportunity to work with clients of all sizes and across all industries. And we celebrate all of our successes together!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity for possibility. We want to enable you to do what you do best and help you develop your skills further with training, development and certifications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global annual &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/dept-cares-day-2023/&quot;&gt;DEPT® Cares Month&lt;/a&gt; in which employees come together and donate their skills to support local charities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY DEPT®?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are a Growth Invention company built to help the world’s most ambitious brands grow faster. Operating at the intersection of technology and marketing, we create what is next by pioneering ideas, acting fast, and moving further because standing still just is not in our DNA.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are drawn to people who stay curious, move with intent, and never stop inventing. Our culture runs on three values: better together, relentlessly curious, and get sh*t done. It is how we work, how we grow, and how we make things that matter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, you will find the freedom to explore, the space to collaborate, and the trust to make a real impact for our clients, for each other, and for the world we are helping to build.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At DEPT®, we take pride in creating an inclusive workplace where everyone has an equal opportunity to thrive. We actively seek to recruit, develop, nurture, and retain talented individuals from diverse backgrounds, with varying skills and perspectives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Not sure you meet all qualifications? Apply, and let us decide! Research shows that women and members of underrepresented groups tend not to apply for jobs when they think they may not meet every requirement, when in fact they do. We believe in giving everyone a fair chance to shine.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also encourage you to reach out to us and discuss any reasonable adjustments we can make to support you throughout the recruitment process and your time with us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Want to know more about our dedication to diversity, equity, and inclusion? Check out our efforts &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.deptagency.com/the-good-company/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP&#39;s content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today&#39;s always on, AI driven marketing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://wpp.com/__;!!JboVxjCXSME!N9KGoZIn5nCC-uOWhEdE-ChrrJuf6TgkLzNNkLaW9BExJsVqZZ_hMSmGbARJ0tdBOnKYM7kEbv5L3ncUpg7-6uEPNdY$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;6ded86b6-cde3-4e48-958d-34727f881edd&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A Hybrid working model&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;We believe the best work happens when we&#39;re together, fostering creativity, collaboration, and connection. That&#39;s why we’ve adopted a hybrid approach, with teams in the office around four days a week. If you require accommodations or flexibility, please discuss this with the hiring team during the interview process.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does a Grade Producer do at WPP Production?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and highly organised&amp;nbsp;Grade Producer&amp;nbsp;to join our UK Post Production team to lead the planning, management and delivery of colour grading projects across our post production operation. This role is central to ensuring grading work is delivered smoothly, creatively and efficiently across a fast-moving commercial environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a specialist production role for someone with a strong understanding of the grading process, colour workflows and finishing pipelines, and who is comfortable coordinating projects across&amp;nbsp;multiple sites, teams and workflows. You will work closely with colourists, producers, editors, online teams, creatives, clients and agency partners to ensure projects are scoped properly, scheduled effectively and delivered to the highest technical and creative standard.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will bring experience from a post production, finishing or colour-focused production environment and will understand how to support both premium attended sessions and more distributed, agile workflows. You will be calm under pressure, highly solutions-oriented and confident managing complex delivery needs across a range of projects, formats and timelines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will play a key role in helping the team deliver excellent colour work at scale - balancing creative ambition, technical accuracy and operational clarity across the full grading process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage grading projects from brief through to final delivery, ensuring clear scope, timings, workflow and resource planning from the outset.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the key point of contact for colour-related projects, connecting clients, agency teams, creatives, colourists and wider post production teams throughout the process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and manage schedules for grading sessions, reviews, conforms, versioning and delivery, aligning resources effectively across multiple sites and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with colourists and finishing teams to support a smooth and well-prepared grading process, ensuring all required assets, references, technical specs and approvals are in place.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate colour workflows across different systems, teams and project types, helping ensure consistency, efficiency and confidence across the operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage budgets, estimates, cost tracking and reconciliations for grading and colour finishing work, maintaining strong commercial control throughout.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Run attended and remote review sessions professionally and calmly, creating an environment in which clients and creatives can focus on the work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with editorial, VFX, CGI, online, audio and delivery teams to ensure grading is integrated seamlessly into the wider post production pipeline.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Anticipate and solve problems relating to availability, workflow, technical setup, client feedback, approvals and delivery timelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure projects are managed with a strong understanding of colour-critical review conditions, delivery standards, version control and final output requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the continuous improvement of grading workflows, operational processes and ways of working across the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong relationships with colourists, assistants, online teams and post producers, helping maintain a collaborative, high-performing studio culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong experience as a&amp;nbsp;Grade Producer,&amp;nbsp;Colour Producer,&amp;nbsp;Finishing Producer&amp;nbsp;or similar role within a high-end post production, finishing or commercial content environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent understanding of grading and colour finishing workflows within high-end post production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good working knowledge of industry-standard grading and finishing environments, including&amp;nbsp;Baselight&amp;nbsp;and&amp;nbsp;DaVinci Resolve, and an understanding of how projects move across different systems and teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to manage multiple projects simultaneously across different workflows, stakeholders and delivery requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with colourists, editors, online teams, producers, agency partners and clients in a commercial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of conform, grading, versioning, review and delivery processes across a range of formats and platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organisational, communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong commercial awareness, with experience managing schedules, scopes, budgets and reconciliations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Calm, solutions-focused and highly detail-oriented, with the ability to keep projects moving smoothly under pressure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A collaborative mindset and the confidence to coordinate work across multiple sites and operational setups.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with remote review workflows and distributed post production models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of HDR, colour pipeline considerations and modern multi-format delivery requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting global brand work, adaptation or multi-market versioning projects.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Awareness of AI-enabled workflow opportunities within post production and finishing environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At WPP Production, you’ll help shape the future of content production at a truly global scale. We bring together world-class talent, cutting-edge studios, and advanced technology to solve some of the most complex creative and production challenges in the industry. You’ll work in a collaborative, borderless environment where craft excellence is valued, innovation is encouraged, and AI and next-generation tools are used to amplify - not replace - human creativity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role offers the chance to define a distinctive creative standard for WPP Production in the UK: partnering with exceptional specialists, influencing major brands, advancing the use of VFX, CGI and AI origination, and building work that is both beautifully crafted and fit for the speed of modern marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-SH2&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-Hybrid&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At WPP Production, you’ll help shape the future of content production at a truly global scale. We bring together world-class talent, cutting-edge studios, and advanced technology to solve some of the most complex creative and production challenges in the industry. You’ll work in a collaborative, borderless environment where craft excellence is valued, innovation is encouraged, and AI and next-generation tools are used to amplify not replace human creativity. With access to diverse projects, global career opportunities, and the backing of WPP’s unmatched network, this is a place where you can grow your skills, make real impact, and create work that performs for every audience, across every channel, at every moment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion and Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on legitimate interest as a legal basis for processing personal information under the GDPR for purposes of recruitment and applications for employment. When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button at the bottom of this page, this will send all the information you have added to WPP Production. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our Privacy&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarthww.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;st&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarth.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;atement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot; style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please contact &lt;a ----- ----- if you need the job advert or form in another format.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP Production&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;ms-outlook-mobile-reference-message skipProofing&quot;&gt;We are WPP Production - the unified global production company that brings together all of WPP&#39;s content producers, studios and craft experts into one connected organisation. We combine world-class human craft with next generation technology to originate, design, and deliver multi-channel content systems at scale. Built for borderless collaboration and powered by deep craft expertise, we are the production engine designed for today&#39;s always on, AI driven marketing world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About WPP&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;WPP is the trusted growth partner for the world’s leading brands. We unite&amp;nbsp;cutting-edge media intelligence and data solutions, world-class creativity, next-generation production, transformative enterprise solutions and expert strategic counsel&amp;nbsp;in a single company –&amp;nbsp;powered by exceptional talent and our agentic marketing platform, WPP Open,&amp;nbsp;to help our clients navigate change, capture opportunity and deliver transformational growth. For more information, visit&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__http://wpp.com/__;!!JboVxjCXSME!N9KGoZIn5nCC-uOWhEdE-ChrrJuf6TgkLzNNkLaW9BExJsVqZZ_hMSmGbARJ0tdBOnKYM7kEbv5L3ncUpg7-6uEPNdY$&quot; data-outlook-id=&quot;6ded86b6-cde3-4e48-958d-34727f881edd&quot;&gt;WPP.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;xmsonormal&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;NB. &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;This role will require working 6 days a week on site in London August through to mid September.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does a&amp;nbsp;&lt;em&gt;Senior Project Manager&lt;/em&gt; do at WPP Production?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a Senior Project Manager role, working as part of a team of PMs and SPMs for this client - an iconic global tech brand. The Senior Project Manager is the primary day-to-day contact with the Client Marcom team and works closely with their Producers, Print Production Manager, and Channel Sales Program (CSP) Managers to originate and/or adaptchannel campaigns in Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build strong client relationships, be the ‘go-to’ person for Channel Marketing asset localization and production&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain a clear understanding of the client’s Channel partner structure and print vendors&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the basics of client service including reviewing scope of work, creating and updating timing plans, contact reports and cost estimates&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead frequent internal and client status meetings, set and manage client expectations ensuring agreed workflows are followed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead high-priority projects and campaigns, managing a cross-functional team, ensuring timely delivery of key milestones. Maintain strong communication with all clients and stakeholders to ensure the project is executed on brief, within budget and on schedule.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flag important scope of work fluctuations to line manager&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build successful relationships with internal teams (Studio, Print Production, Senior Account Management, Operations)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Brief studio and print production teams, and ensure that the correct creative direction is being taken&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Immerse yourself in the client’s brand and offering, act as a brand QC/Guardian – always ensure brand guidelines, QC checklists and procedures are followed&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage two project managers, setting clear objectives and goals to drive performance. Support their career development by identifying and facilitating training opportunities.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with resourcing team, organise teamwork, create a balanced work schedule and ensure people are able to deliver results.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure your account consistently delivers against all contractual obligations including SLAs and KPIs&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate a thorough understanding of the Hogarth business model, services and technology&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Resolve and/or escalate issues swiftly.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify bottlenecks, work with Ops team to optimize structure, team and processes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid agency experience gained working on global retail and/or shopper accounts, from creative development to final production. Localization experience is a must.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing new features, availability and regulatory requirements across multiple markets for a global tech brand&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience of Channel distribution models, both production and delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complicated copy blocks&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate expertise in the delivery of projects through management of client expectations, internal processes and department involvement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience in team management is essential.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills, written and verbal&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to write and present documents, presentations and reports to a large audience&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent spreadsheet skills in both Excel and Numbers.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attention to detail, analytical thinking ability and passion for the work are essential&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A hands-on, can-do approach to solving problems&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to prioritize and work quickly and efficiently within very tight timeframes&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrate clear thinking under pressure&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be able to work onsite full time with the team in London for 3-4 weeks, up to 3 times per year (hybrid working the rest of the time&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;#LI-LS1&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why work here:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;At WPP Production, you’ll help shape the future of content production at a truly global scale. We bring together world-class talent, cutting-edge studios, and advanced technology to solve some of the most complex creative and production challenges in the industry. You’ll work in a collaborative, borderless environment where craft excellence is valued, innovation is encouraged, and AI and next-generation tools are used to amplify not replace human creativity. With access to diverse projects, global career opportunities, and the backing of WPP’s unmatched network, this is a place where you can grow your skills, make real impact, and create work that performs for every audience, across every channel, at every moment. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Inclusion and Impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;WPP is an equal opportunity employer and considers applicants for all positions without discrimination or regard to particular characteristics. We are committed to fostering a culture of respect in which everyone feels they belong and has the same opportunities to progress in their careers. &lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on legitimate interest as a legal basis for processing personal information under the GDPR for purposes of recruitment and applications for employment. When you click the &quot;Submit Application&quot; button at the bottom of this page, this will send all the information you have added to WPP Production. Before you do this, we think it&#39;s a good idea to read through our Privacy&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarthww.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;st&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.hogarth.com/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;atement&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/span&gt; This explains what we do with your personal data when you apply for a role with us, and, how you can update the information you have provided us with or how to remove it.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
