&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What does a&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;Senior Creative Technologist&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;do at WPP Production?&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;A Senior Creative Technologist is a confident technical and creative leader who delivers&amp;nbsp;exceptional work and elevates the team around them with +10 years of experience. The&amp;nbsp;candidate should have strong understanding of the creative and production industry,&amp;nbsp;ultimately worked within a creative agency (or in-house agency) or a production company for&amp;nbsp;a vast majority of their career.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;They can shape ideas, briefs and expand on concepts, not only execute them.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;They don’t just build prototypes; they think about how things can scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;They don’t just solve problems; they spot them early and think about mitigating risk.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;They are comfortable working with clients and have strong presentation skills.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;The Senior CT plays a supporting leadership role across strategic and creative delivery,&amp;nbsp;mentoring and standards. Senior CTs own workstreams, line manage junior team members&amp;nbsp;and help ensure that what we ship is technically robust, creatively ambitious and compliant&amp;nbsp;with corporate and client expectations. The Senior CT has strong technical capabilities to&amp;nbsp;guide teams about the suitable models they should work with for each project and provide&amp;nbsp;technical support for the different models, programs and tools.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Line manages Creative Technologists&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Set clear expectations and support personal development plans&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Run regular, 1:1 with honest feedback loops&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Actively mentor less confident team members, creating space for them to grow&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Confidently propose and justify technical approaches in response to briefs&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Take responsibility for ensuring creative and technical output meets corporate and&amp;nbsp;client standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Work closely with Producers/PMs to scope realistically and protect quality&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Turn ideas into meaningful prototypes that support internal new business&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Balance experimentation with integrated production discipline&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Anticipate technical risks and resolve issues early&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Develop scalable workflows across AI, real-time and other emerging tech&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Encourage ownership and pride in output&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Share knowledge openly and raise the overall capability of the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Escalate when something doesn’t match the brief or standards&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Be the bridge between Creative, Strategy, Production and Tech&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Clearly explain complex technical approaches to non-technical audiences&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Represent the Creative Technology team confidently in client settings&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Provide transparent updates on progress, blockers and risks&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Give constructive, solution-focused feedback&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Proactively identify opportunities to prototype new ideas or tools&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Contribute to group R&amp;amp;D initiatives&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Stay curious about emerging tech and share insights with the team&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Requirements&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Strong capability across multiple areas such as: Unreal (Blueprints, UEFN, Verse),&amp;nbsp;creative coding, generative AI workflows, AR/VR, 3D, interaction design, world&amp;nbsp;building, automation pipelines etc.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Proven ability to deliver high-quality technical work with minimal oversight&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Experience mentoring or line managing junior team members&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Strong troubleshooting skills across technical/creative pipelines&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Confident communicator both internally and with clients.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Comfortable working in fast-paced, deadline-driven environments&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; High standards and a strong sense of accountability&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Great collaborator and team player that is used to working with multiple stakeholders&amp;nbsp;co-owning a project&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p2&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;s1&quot;&gt;•&lt;/span&gt; Commercial awareness and understanding of production realities&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p3&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;#LI-RH1&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
